<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">离线之后，也能回看</view><view class="title">历史事件</view><view class="filters"><view class="filter {{node===-1?'active':''}}" data-node="-1" bindtap="filter">全部</view><view class="filter {{node===0?'active':''}}" data-node="0" bindtap="filter">玄铁主站</view><view class="filter {{node===1?'active':''}}" data-node="1" bindtap="filter">星火</view><view class="filter {{node===2?'active':''}}" data-node="2" bindtap="filter">龙芯</view></view><view class="sub spaced">新收到的记录排在前面；断网后补传的旧事件也可能出现在顶部。每条记录都标明了时间来源。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card event" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="event-icon {{item.bad?'bad':''}}"/><view class="event-body"><view class="row"><text class="event-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="arrow">›</text></view><view class="sub">{{item.name}} · {{item.source==='device'?'设备记录':'云端观察'}}</view><view class="time">{{item.timeText}} · {{item.timeLabel}}</view><view class="tag">{{item.diagnosis.confidence}}</view><view class="sub">{{item.snapshot?'已保存事件前读数':'尚无可用的事件前读数'}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length&&!loading}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-title">还没有符合条件的事件</view><view>记录服务启动之前的历史不会自动出现在这里。</view></view><button wx:if="{{next}}" class="btn secondary" loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="more">查看更早的事件</button><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="sub">正在读取…</view></view>
